@baseUrl = https://localhost:7017
# Paste a Keycloak access token from your authenticated demo session or API client.
@token = paste-access-token

### Device list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/devices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Device details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/devices/pi4-1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Register a new device (choose an unused source node)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/devices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"device_id":"pi4-5","node_id":99,"label":"Additional Pi","reporting_interval_seconds":300}

### Edit metadata; source node cannot be changed
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/devices/pi4-5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"label":"North field","enabled":false}

### Decommission; history is preserved
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/devices/pi4-5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Latest source-time readings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/telemetry/latest?deviceIds=pi4-1,pi4-2,pi4-3,pi4-4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Source-time history: inclusive from, exclusive to. URL-encode next_cursor when paging.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/devices/pi4-1/telemetry/history?from=2025-07-24T00:00:00Z&to=2025-07-25T00:00:00Z&limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Hourly averages; change interval to day for daily buckets
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/devices/pi4-1/telemetry/aggregates?from=2025-07-24T00:00:00Z&to=2025-07-25T00:00:00Z&interval=hour
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Storage and live notification status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Expected 404 Problem Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/devices/nonexistent-device
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Liveness (no authentication)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live
